       "@type": "Person",
       "name": "Gloria Ronga"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Clean store well stocked and Natalia was great answering all my questions that I had! 35% off first time buyer! What’s not to love! Will definitely go back again and again!",
      "reviewRating": {
       "@type": "Rating",
       "ratingValue": "5"
      }
     },
     {
      "@type": "Review",
      "author": {
       "@type": "Person",
       "name": "Penny Blake"
      },
      "reviewBody": "I went here a few weeks ago and had the most lovely experience. Cathy was super helpful and kind, and had the best recommendations! 10/10 my absolute favorite dispensary I've ever gone to and will definitely be back. Thank you Cathy - you are truly the best!",
      "reviewRating": {
       "@type": "Rating",
       "ratingValue": "5"
      }
     },
     {
      "@type": "Review",
      "author": {
       "@type": "Person",
       "name": "Dennis Perry"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Hwy 90 an OG of Marlton is the spot! Low key 🔥. Fast service. Always very helpful and friendly, Diamond is usually my girl and knows what I like.",
      "reviewRating": {
       "@type": "Rating",
       "ratingValue": "5"
      }
     },
     {
      "@type": "Review",
